pon equally strong in every situation. Different weapons should still have their own strengths, weaknesses, counters, and synergies — but the overall meta should now be much more stable and balanced.This update also includes a large ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T20:29:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4940230-1840944183787432","game_id":"steam-4940230","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #1 — Russian Localization, Ranked Matchmaking & UI","summary":"Demo Update #1 is live!This update includes a few improvements based on the first days of players trying the Demo:Russian LocalizationFull Russian localization is now available.You can switch languages from the Settings menu.Improved Ranked MatchmakingRanked matchmaking now takes each player's highest achieved Rank into account.New SCRAP players are matched only against builds created by other SCRAP players.As you climb, stronger opponents are introduced gradually.This should make the first Rank","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T23:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4940230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4940230":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4940230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:07Z"},"5046900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T